<bx:output>
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
	<meta charset="utf-8">
	<title>#prc.pageTitle#</title>
	<style>
		body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 640px; margin: 4rem auto; padding: 0 1.25rem; color: ##1f2937; line-height: 1.5; }
		h1   { margin-bottom: 0.25rem; }
		.lead { color: ##6b7280; margin-top: 0; }
		code { background: ##f3f4f6; padding: 0.1rem 0.35rem; border-radius: 3px; font-size: 0.95em; }
		ul   { padding-left: 1.25rem; }
		li   { margin: 0.4rem 0; }
		.note { margin-top: 2rem; padding: 1rem 1.25rem; background: ##f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid ##3b82f6; border-radius: 4px; }
	</style>
</head>
<body>
	<h1>Project Management installed</h1>
	<p class="lead">The <code>tesserabx-pm</code> add-on is loaded and routable.</p>

	<p>This is a Phase 0 placeholder. The full PM surface (projects, tasks, kanban board, time tracking, AI features, client portal) lands across Phases 1 through 13.</p>

	<ul>
		<li>Module slug: <code>tesserabx-pm</code></li>
		<li>Entry point: <code>/tesserabx-pm</code></li>
		<li>Manifest: <code>settings.tesserabx</code> in <code>ModuleConfig.bx</code></li>
	</ul>

	<div class="note">
		<strong>For operators:</strong> verify the add-on is discovered at <code>/agent/admin/addons</code>. It should appear with <code>compatible : true</code>.
	</div>
</body>
</html>
</bx:output>
